     "narrationArabic": "تقترح إيلي أن يرتاح ليث بعد حمل الصندوق، لكنه يريد إتمام مهمة صغيرة فقط."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "sceneId": "SC_A1_D12_LEARNING",
   "kind": "learning",
   "isLearningInput": true,
   "purposeArabic": "التعبير عن الرفض اللطيف واقتراح بديل.",
   "lines": [
    {
     "lineId": "L_A1_JA_D12_01",
     "speakerId": "elly",
     "targetText": "こんにちは、レイス。今は休んだほうがいいよ。",
     "englishReference": "Hello, Laith. You should rest now.",
     "arabicTranslation": "مرحبًا يا ليث. ينبغي أن ترتاح الآن.",
     "pronunciation": "konnichiha , raisu . ima ha yasun dahougaiiyo .",
     "gesture": {
      "kind": "none",
      "instructionalRole": "none"
     },
     "phraseIds": [
      "P_A1_JA_D12_S01"
     ],
     "teachingExposure": "context"
    },
    {
     "lineId": "L_A1_JA_D12_02",
     "speakerId": "laith",
     "targetText": "ありがとう、でも怠惰にはなりたくない。",
     "englishReference": "Thank you, but I do not want to be idle.",
     "arabicTranslation": "شكرًا، لكنني لا أريد أن أبقى بلا عمل.",
     "pronunciation": "arigatou , demo taida nihanaritakunai .",
     "gesture": {
      "kind": "none",
      "instructionalRole": "none"
     },
     "phraseIds": [
      "P_A1_JA_D12_I01"
     ],
     "teachingExposure": "new"
    },
    {
     "lineId": "L_A1_JA_D12_03",
     "speakerId": "elly",
     "targetText": "あなたは午前中ずっと働きました。",
     "englishReference": "You worked all morning.",
     "arabicTranslation": "لقد عملت طوال الصباح.",
     "pronunciation": "anataha gozenchuu zutto hataraki mashita .",
     "gesture": {
      "kind": "none",
      "instructionalRole": "none"
     },
     "phraseIds": [
      "P_A1_JA_D12_C01"
     ],
     "teachingExposure": "new"
    },
    {
     "lineId": "L_A1_JA_D12_04",
     "speakerId": "laith",
     "targetText": "知っている。小さなタスクを 1 つ実行できます。",
     "englishReference": "I know. I can do one small task.",
     "arabicTranslation": "أعرف. يمكنني أن أفعل مهمة صغيرة واحدة.",
     "pronunciation": "shitte iru . chiisa na tasuku wo  1  tsu jikkou dekimasu .",
     "gesture": {
      "kind": "none",
      "instructionalRole": "none"
     },
     "phraseIds": [
      "P_A1_JA_D12_S02"
     ],
     "teachingExposure": "context"
    },
    {
     "lineId": "L_A1_JA_D12_05",
     "speakerId": "elly",
     "targetText": "どのようなタスクを実行したいですか?",
     "englishReference": "What task do you want to do?",
     "arabicTranslation": "ما المهمة التي تريد فعلها؟",
     "pronunciation": "donoyouna tasuku wo jikkou shitaidesuka ?",
     "gesture": {
      "kind": "none",
      "instructionalRole": "none"
     },
     "phraseIds": [
      "P_A1_JA_D12_C02"
     ],
     "teachingExposure": "new"
    },
    {
     "lineId": "L_A1_JA_D12_06",
     "speakerId": "laith",
     "targetText": "道具をきれいにしたい。",
     "englishReference": "I want to clean the tools.",
     "arabicTranslation": "أريد تنظيف الأدوات.",
     "pronunciation": "dougu wokireinishitai .",
     "gesture": {
      "kind": "none",
      "instructionalRole": "none"
     },
     "phraseIds": [
      "P_A1_JA_D12_C03"
     ],
     "teachingExposure": "new"
    },
    {
     "lineId": "L_A1_JA_D12_07",
     "speakerId": "elly",
     "targetText": "よし。その後は休んでください。",
     "englishReference": "All right. Then rest after that.",
     "arabicTranslation": "حسنًا. ثم استرح بعد ذلك.",
     "pronunciation": "yoshi . sono nochi ha yasun dekudasai .",
     "gesture": {
      "kind": "none",
      "instructionalRole": "none"
     },
     "phraseIds": [
      "P_A1_JA_D12_S03"
     ],
     "teachingExposure": "context"
    },
    {
     "lineId": "L_A1_JA_D12_08",
     "speakerId": "laith",
     "targetText": "はい、そうします。とりあえずさようなら。",
     "englishReference": "Yes, I will. Goodbye for now.",
     "arabicTranslation": "نعم، سأفعل. إلى اللقاء الآن.",
     "pronunciation": "hai , soushimasu . toriaezusayounara .",
     "gesture": {
      "kind": "none",
      "instructionalRole": "none"
     },
     "phraseIds": [
